   "text": "KOSPI closed up 2.60% at 5,375.36, after a 4.39% jump the day before. SK hynix and Samsung Electronics led, and foreign investors were net buyers. This morning your dashboard prices SCBKEQTG at its 9 Nov NAV, so the two-day gain is not in it yet.",
